{'symbol': 'TRV', 'date': '2022-02-23 09:00:00', 'title': 'TRŌV TECHNOLOGY ASSETS ACQUIRED BY TRAVELERS', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO, FEB. 23, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TRŌV, ONE OF THE EARLIEST AND MOST WIDELY RECOGNIZED INSURTECHS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS TECHNOLOGY HAS BEEN ACQUIRED BY THE TRAVELERS COMPANIES, INC. (NYSE:\xa0TRV), A LEADING PROVIDER OF PROPERTY CASUALTY INSURANCE FOR AUTO, HOME AND BUSINESS. MOST MEMBERS OF TRŌV'S TEAM HAVE ALSO JOINED THE COMPANY."}